	"notice": "Set Global Page 3A MIDI Ch to match the other device. Configurable panel assignments and NRPN editing are omitted. This profile describes the keyboard MS2000 rather than the MS2000R rack. For computer use, connect MIDI OUT to interface MIDI IN; connect interface MIDI OUT to hardware MIDI IN when controlling the instrument. Port names are intentionally empty: interface or app names do not reliably identify the attached hardware. Select this profile manually. This is partial coverage, not a complete MIDI implementation. The panel is an original schematic; virtual keyboard note numbers are illustrative and require MIDI learn or octave adjustment.",
